get.description:
Stream job events via Server-Sent Events (SSE)

Real-time updates for job progress

Usage (JavaScript):
    const eventSource = new EventSource('/api/v1/jobs/JOB_ID/events');
    eventSource.addEventListener('job.planning.completed', (event) => {
        const data = JSON.parse(event.data);
        console.log('Planning done:', data);
    });
